## Third-party data attributions

This project incorporates data and methods from several third-party sources.
None impose copyleft or licensing obligations on Aster v2's source code. See
the NOTICE file for full attribution details:
- Tycho-2 star catalog (ESO/VizieR)
- NEA orbital elements (NASA JPL Small-Body Database)
- Solar system body ephemerides (NASA JPL Horizons System)
- Lambert problem algorithm reference (Izzo 2014, arXiv:1403.2705)
- Lambert validation test vectors (poliastro project, MIT-licensed)
